{"id":"e87d65e94fa4321e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-quotient-uniqueness.md","title":"df-quotient-uniqueness","display":"df-quotient-uniqueness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-quotient-uniqueness","aliases":["16-df-quotient-uniqueness","Uniqueness of quotient presentations"],"display":"df-quotient-uniqueness","depends_on":["[[16-df-quotient-type]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-quotient-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-quotient-uniqueness</span><span>Uniqueness of quotient presentations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e29c92ba515d8b86\" href=\"?note=e29c92ba515d8b86\" title=\"16-df-quotient-type\">16-df-quotient-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 是 Eq-fibration；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:I\\to Q\">\\(q:I\\to Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q&#39;:I\\to Q&#39;\">\\(q&#39;:I\\to Q&#39;\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e29c92ba515d8b86\" href=\"?note=e29c92ba515d8b86\" title=\"16-df-quotient-type\">16-df-quotient-type</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\">\\(\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotUnique}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotUnique}\\)</span> 为下文定义的保持同一商图的唯一性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,Q&#39;))\\\n\\bigl(hq=q&#39;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,Q&#39;))\\\n\\bigl(hq=q&#39;\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q&#39;,q&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q&#39;,q&#39;)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q&#39;,q&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由两次泛性质得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Q\\to Q&#39;\">\\(h:Q\\to Q&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:Q&#39;\\to Q\">\\(k:Q&#39;\\to Q\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hq=q&#39;\">\\(hq=q&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kq&#39;=q\">\\(kq&#39;=q\\)</span>；唯一性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kh=\\operatorname{id}_Q\">\\(kh=\\operatorname{id}_Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hk=\\operatorname{id}_{Q&#39;}\">\\(hk=\\operatorname{id}_{Q&#39;}\\)</span>。比较必须保持同一商图，裸商载体同构不足以恢复原关系。签名随正确的基范畴商同步。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-quotient-type","status":"resolved","id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-quotient-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-quotient-type","status":"resolved","id":"e29c92ba515d8b86","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$。$q:I\\to Q$、$q':I\\to Q'$ 使用 [[16-df-quotient-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)$。$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 是 Eq-fibration；$I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}$。$q:I\\to Q$、$q':I\\to Q'$ 使用 [[16-df-quotient-type]] 的 $\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)$。$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal E_{I\\times I}","display":false},{"tex":"q:I\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"q':I\\to Q'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotUnique}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q',q')\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q',q')\\\\\n&\\land(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(Q,Q'))\\\n\\bigl(hq=q'\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q,q)\\land\\mathsf{Quot}_p(I,R;Q',q')\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{QuotUnique}_p(I,R;Q,q,Q',q').","display":true},{"tex":"h:Q\\to Q'","display":false},{"tex":"k:Q'\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"hq=q'","display":false},{"tex":"kq'=q","display":false},{"tex":"kh=\\operatorname{id}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"hk=\\operatorname{id}_{Q'}","display":false}],"bytes":1399,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-quotient-uniqueness|df-quotient-uniqueness]]"}],"outgoing":["e29c92ba515d8b86","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}